{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/2839411/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/2839411/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/2839411/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年末は地元に帰ってる和田まあやです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/2839411/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はおばあちゃん家に行ったり美容室に行ったりお買い物に行ったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/2839411/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は友達も呼んで自宅でお鍋パーティーするんだぁo(^o^)oWAKWAK"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃん誕生日おめでとう〜♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/2839411/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頼りになるカッコ可愛い素敵なお姉ちゃんです♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/2839411/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な１年になりますように"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/2839411/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして！なんと！なんとっ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木ここMVPを頂きました〜o(^o^)o\n皆様ありがとうございました!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/2839411/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさか\nまあやがMVPをもらえるなんて全然思ってなかったからビックリしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/2839411/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/2839411/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう〜♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/2839411/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の質問の何時に寝ますか？\nで！思ってたより寝る時間が少ないんだな〜って思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/2839411/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中にはブログを読んでコメントを書いてると遅くなるって方が居て、\n眠いのにコメントを書いてくれて本当にありがたいな〜って思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/2839411/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやはレッスンの終わる時間によって違うんだけど、遅い時は1時で、早く寝れる時は11時頃に寝るかな〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/2839411/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう今年も後１日で終わりますね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/2839411/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ものすごくいろんな事がありました..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/2839411/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワクワクドキドキして上京してきたのに心が壊れそうになって、でも自分がきめて出てきたんだから...とか...なんか心がグジャグジャになって..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰にも言えなくて...毎日泣いてた事もありました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、そんな時に私を支えてくれたのは、コメントや握手会で元気をくれる乃木坂familyの皆"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/2839411/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーやスタッフさん\n時々地元に帰ったり...\nどれだけ心が強くなったか\n皆が居てくれたから、\nまあやは１人じゃないんだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思って頑張ってこれました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/2839411/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもずっと一緒にいてもらえるように、まあやはまあやらしく頑張って行きます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/2839411/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の乃木坂familyの方や、\nまあや族にあえてとっても嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/2839411/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年はまあやのまわりの皆に\nもっともっと\n笑顔になってもらえるように頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/2839411/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年も宜しくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/2839411/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/2839411/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/2839411/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/12/31/2839411/0006.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}